  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2c3c456686982df45abd9b1cebe9549e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLibrarySO
  m_entries:
  - speaker: Gao
    content: My father, you had been caught by the God <color=#FFDC88>Shu</color>.
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "@\u5411\u5DE6\u770B"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "@\u7B49\u5F851\u79D2"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: My father, how can I find your trace?
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u5411\u5DE6\u770B"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u4EE54\u4E3A\u901F\u5EA6\u79FB\u52A8"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u79FB\u52A8\u5230-5.31"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: Your father is <color=#FFDC88>Egaole</color>, right?
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u7B49\u5F851\u79D2"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "@\u5411\u53F3\u770B"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "@\u7B49\u5F851\u79D2"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: And you, you are <color=#FFDC88>Gaolequ</color>.
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: Exactly. Dear fox, how do you know us?
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u7B49\u5F851\u79D2"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: Gao, the damage you two have caused to nature was so much!
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: You even violated the contract and captured the wild boar of the God
      Shu!
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: Well...but I don't think Shu has the right to catch my father.
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u7B49\u5F851\u79D2"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: Gao, your father is imprisoned on <color=#9876C5>the fifth hill</color>,
      and <color=#FFDC88>this</color> is the first one.
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u5411\u53F3\u770B"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u7B49\u5F852\u79D2"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: To <color=#6AADFF>reconcile</color> rather than continue to destroy
      nature, otherwise you will also fall into the same fate.
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u79FB\u52A8\u52309.79"
    note: 
  - speaker: Fox
    content: "@\u9690\u85CF"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "It disappered\u2026"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: My father often said that, the south slope is sunny, the north valley
      is shady.
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: And all white things go up, all black things go down, that's the rule.
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "The snakes are twisting with each other, I can't pass through this
      way\u2026"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "Hey, could you please\u2026"
    note: 
  - speaker: Snakes
    content: "Hiss\u2026hiss\u2026"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: Aha, thanks.
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "Well\u2026the stones seem to be the next trouble."
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "@\u7B49\u5F851\u79D2"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "@\u5411\u5DE6\u770B"
    note: 
  - speaker: Snakes
    content: "Hiss\u2026hiss\u2026"
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: If I go to resolve the dispute between these two snakes first, will
      I also find another way?
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: "Maybe\u2026the fox is right."
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: This is the southern cave.
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: This is the northern cave.
    note: 
  - speaker: Gao
    content: So many rocks, I'm definitely reaching the peak.
    note: 
  m_linkedCsvPath: Assets/Dialogues/Level 0.csv
